Description:It is your first main phase. You control Lowland Tracker (2/2, first strike, provoke). The opponent is at 20 life and controls a tapped Grizzly Bears. Destroy the opponent's Grizzly Bears this turn while keeping Lowland Tracker.
Rule:authored-provoke-untaps | Provoke triggers on attack and makes the target creature untap and block the attacker if able (CR 702.39a): attack with Lowland Tracker and target the tapped Grizzly Bears, which untaps, must block, and dies to first-strike damage before it can strike back; a tapped creature is not out of reach of provoke
